<h2>Asobi Review 0.2 (build 468)</h2>
<p><b>Exports made while optimised media is loaded are correct again.</b></p>
<ul>
<li><b>Fixed: movie exports, session reels and batch frame exports could come out with the wrong colour</b> when optimised media was in use (build 467 only). They correctly re-read the original files, but decoded them through the stand-in's log curve — a visible shift, not a subtle one.</li>
<li>Every export path now re-resolves the original's colour as well as its pixels. Verified pixel-identical to exporting with no optimised media at all.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
